    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >STORY</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Nut City Police Department is full of eccentric characters. Captain Fox, for example, is a venerated veteran police officer whose favourite day of the week is Monday. And the new intern, Detective Raccoon, is a young, dumb and hot-headed pizza lover who is always sniffing for ways to bend the rules.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The unlikely pair have to team up this summer to explore Nut City\u2019s neon-washed streets, meet its strange citizens, and tackle bizarre cases. Danger looms around the corner, but love also blossoms.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Be careful of where to look and which path to choose, because all actions have consequences. Will Captain Fox and Detective Raccoon form a deeper bond, or part ways in bitterness?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The future is in your paws.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >FEATURES</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Crudely drawn but still lovable pixel animals </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Various unique locations with secrets to uncover </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Casual puzzles  </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >5 <span class=\"bb_strike\">comical</span> thrilling cases! </p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >6 endings!</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >CONTROLS</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Mouse Left Click/Space Bar - Advances dialogue </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >CTRL - Fast forward </p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >F - Toggles full-screen mode</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >INSPIRATIONS</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The character dynamics are loosely inspired by <i>Cyberpunk 2077,</i> <i>The Darkside Detective</i>, <i>The X-Files</i>, and 90s buddy cop movies. </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" > </h2>",
